# Transit Community Edition reads NO secrets from the environment.
#
# - Device credentials live in the OS keystore, 1Password (via `op` or the
#   SSH agent), an SSH agent, or an on-disk key file — never here.
# - AI provider keys (Anthropic / OpenAI) are enrolled in Settings → API keys
#   and stored in the OS keychain. There is no env-var path for them.
#
# Optional development overrides:
# TRANSIT_INVENTORY=/path/to/transit.toml     # inventory file location
# TRANSIT_SECRET_BACKEND=keyring              # default secret backend
# TRANSIT_CONFIG=/path/to/config.toml         # app config location
